# 10. NAVIGATION & CHROME

### Keyboard

| Key | Action |
|---|---|
| `→` or `Space` | Next slide |
| `←` | Previous slide |
| `Home` | First slide |
| `End` | Last slide |
| `O` | Toggle overview grid |
| `F` | Toggle fullscreen |
| `Esc` | Exit fullscreen or overview |
| `1`–`9` then `Enter` | Jump to slide 1–9 |

### Mouse / Touch

- Click right half → next. Click left half → previous.
- Swipe left/right on touch devices.
- Auto-hiding chrome: progress bar + slide counter + nav arrows. Appear on mouse move, fade after 3s idle.

### Progress Bar

3px height, fixed top, `--bg-linen` track, `--coral` fill, animated width (`transition: width 0.4s var(--ease-out)`).

### Slide Counter

Top-right, `14px`, `--text-soft`, tabular-nums: `04 / 23`. On dark slides: `--text-on-dark`.

### Overview Grid

Full-screen overlay. 4-column grid on desktop, 2-column on tablet. Each cell: rendered canvas snapshot (or live thumbnail), rounded-xl, shadow-md, hover → scale 1.04 + shadow-lg. Click → jump. Current slide highlighted with coral border.

