# 11. RESPONSIVE & PERFORMANCE

### Device Tiers

| Tier | Detection | 3D | Images |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Desktop** (≥1280px, no touch, good GPU) | `!('ontouchstart' in window) && hardwareConcurrency >= 6` | Full 3D, all effects, postprocessing | WebP |
| **Tablet** (768–1279px or touch) | Touch detected or narrower viewport | Full 3D, no postprocessing, lower DPR (1.0) | WebP |
| **Low-end** (< 768px or weak GPU) | `hardwareConcurrency < 4` or WebGL failure | Pre-rendered PNG fallbacks | JPEG |

### Performance Targets

| Metric | Target |
|---|---|
| First Contentful Paint | < 1.5s |
| First 3D frame | < 3.0s |
| Frame rate (desktop) | ≥ 55 FPS |
| Frame rate (tablet) | ≥ 30 FPS |
| Total asset size | < 8 MB (all models + images + code) |
| Per-slide 3D payload | < 250 KB (lazy-loaded) |
| Code (JS + CSS) | < 300 KB |

### Lazy Loading

Each 3D scene loads only when its slide is within ±1 of the current slide. Previous scenes dispose after ±3 slides. Model cache persists across slides.

